import{_ as i,o as t,c as a,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 681 | Dual-Track Time Domain | Time Domain and Origin-Three-Basic Synergy","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 681 | Dual-Track Time Domain | Time Domain and Origin-Three-Basic Synergy","no":681,"module":3,"tags":["Origin Three-Basic","Deduction-Iteration","Life-Cycle","Spatial-Law Dispatch","Time Domain"],"related":["11-Deduction-Iteration System Details","12-Life-Cycle System Details","13-Spatial-Law Dispatch System Details"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0681_模块3-双轨时间域-时间域与本源三基的协同.md","filePath":"en/0681_模块3-双轨时间域-时间域与本源三基的协同.md"}'),o={name:"en/0681_模块3-双轨时间域-时间域与本源三基的协同.md"};function s(r,e,l,h,c,d){return t(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n(`<h1 id="entry-681-dual-track-time-domain-time-domain-and-origin-three-basic-synergy" tabindex="-1">Entry 681 | Dual-Track Time Domain | Time Domain and Origin-Three-Basic Synergy <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-681-dual-track-time-domain-time-domain-and-origin-three-basic-synergy" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 681 | Dual-Track Time Domain | Time Domain and Origin-Three-Basic Synergy&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain | Benchmark base: Documents 11, 12, 13 | Series: Dual-Track-Time-Domain Overview Deepening (Entry 15)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-origin-three-basic-are-the-three-cornerstones-of-all-cultivation-the-time-domain-is-their-runtime" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the Origin Three-Basic are the three cornerstones of all cultivation; the time domain is their runtime <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-origin-three-basic-are-the-three-cornerstones-of-all-cultivation-the-time-domain-is-their-runtime" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the Origin Three-Basic are the three cornerstones of all cultivation; the time domain is their runtime&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Origin Three-Basic — Deduction-Iteration (Set 1), Life-Cycle (Set 2), Spatial-Law Dispatch (Set 3) — are the three most foundational sets among the 300; every other set is built on these three cornerstones. The three cornerstones each have their own nature: deduction tilts to computing, life tilts to experience, spatial tilts to dispatch. These three natures precisely correspond to different functions of the dual-track time domain. Six top-level axioms here set synergy direction: anti-predation axiom requires all three basics develop increments; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires the three basics be open to 99% of beings; collective ascension axiom requires outputs backflow; causal self-discipline axiom requires the three basics not disturb causality; law-first axiom requires the three-basic definitions stable. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. This entry sorts out the synergy mechanism between the time domain and the Origin Three-Basic.</p><h2 id="i-the-three-basics-role-division-in-the-time-domain" tabindex="-1">I. The Three Basics&#39; Role Division in the Time Domain <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-three-basics-role-division-in-the-time-domain" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. The Three Basics&#39; Role Division in the Time Domain&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_1-1-deduction-iteration-set-1-the-acceleration-domain-s-main-engine" tabindex="-1">1.1 Deduction-Iteration (Set 1): The Acceleration Domain&#39;s Main Engine <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-1-deduction-iteration-set-1-the-acceleration-domain-s-main-engine" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.1 Deduction-Iteration (Set 1): The Acceleration Domain&#39;s Main Engine&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The core of the Deduction-Iteration system is &quot;iterating laws with computing power.&quot; The Origin Acceleration Domain&#39;s hundred-fold deduction amplification (Entry 503) is almost designed for it: the acceleration domain provides high flow; Deduction-Iteration provides the algorithm; the two combine to produce exponential growth of civilizational iteration. This is the &quot;fast&quot; pole of the dual-track time domain.</p><h3 id="_1-2-life-cycle-set-2-the-quest-domain-s-main-textbook" tabindex="-1">1.2 Life-Cycle (Set 2): The Quest Domain&#39;s Main Textbook <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-2-life-cycle-set-2-the-quest-domain-s-main-textbook" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.2 Life-Cycle (Set 2): The Quest Domain&#39;s Main Textbook&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The core of the Life-Cycle system is &quot;experiencing life&#39;s birth, aging, sickness, death, and cycles.&quot; This experience cannot be accelerated — you cannot &quot;experience&quot; a hundred years of aging and rebirth in the acceleration domain; that is a pseudo-experience. The Quest Sediment Domain provides real time for the Life-Cycle system: cultivators fully live through life rhythm in slow trials, turning knowledge into embodied knowing. This is the &quot;slow&quot; pole of the dual-track time domain.</p><h3 id="_1-3-spatial-law-dispatch-set-3-the-dual-track-connector" tabindex="-1">1.3 Spatial-Law Dispatch (Set 3): The Dual-Track Connector <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-3-spatial-law-dispatch-set-3-the-dual-track-connector" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.3 Spatial-Law Dispatch (Set 3): The Dual-Track Connector&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The core of the Spatial-Law Dispatch system is &quot;dispatching spatial resources across the four-layer structure of material plane, energy layer, consciousness domain, and law network.&quot; It needs both the acceleration domain&#39;s deduction (designing dispatch schemes) and the Quest domain&#39;s practice (executing on real planes); it is the connector joining the two tracks. Without Spatial-Law Dispatch, acceleration-domain deduction cannot land; Quest-domain experience cannot expand.</p><h2 id="ii-triangle-synergy-of-the-three-basics-and-the-dual-track" tabindex="-1">II. Triangle Synergy of the Three Basics and the Dual Track <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-triangle-synergy-of-the-three-basics-and-the-dual-track" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Triangle Synergy of the Three Basics and the Dual Track&quot;">​</a></h2><div class="language- vp-adaptive-theme"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang"></span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span>        Deduction-Iteration (Acceleration Domain)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>           /         \\</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>          /           \\</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>   Spatial-Law Dispatch (Dual-Track Connector)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>          \\           /</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>           \\         /</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        Life-Cycle (Quest Domain)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>In the triangle: Deduction-Iteration provides &quot;fast&quot;; Life-Cycle provides &quot;deep&quot;; Spatial-Law Dispatch provides &quot;solid.&quot; The three are indispensable — deduction alone is hollow; life alone stagnates; dispatch alone loses direction. The dual-track time domain lets the three basics each do their own work while supporting each other.</p><h2 id="iii-time-pacing-of-three-basic-synergy" tabindex="-1">III. Time Pacing of Three-Basic Synergy <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-time-pacing-of-three-basic-synergy" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Time Pacing of Three-Basic Synergy&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Suggested time pacing when a cultivator learns the three basics:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Stage</th><th>Deduction-Iteration</th><th>Life-Cycle</th><th>Spatial-Law Dispatch</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Entry</td><td>30%</td><td>40%</td><td>30%</td></tr><tr><td>Advanced</td><td>40%</td><td>30%</td><td>30%</td></tr><tr><td>Mastery</td><td>35%</td><td>25%</td><td>40%</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Entry period weights Life-Cycle (rooting); advanced period weights Deduction-Iteration (burst); mastery period weights Spatial-Law Dispatch (landing). Pacing dynamically adjusts by stage — this is precisely the balancing art (Entry 667)&#39;s expression on three-basic learning.</p><h2 id="iv-three-basic-synergy-and-the-lin-hao-archetype" tabindex="-1">IV. Three-Basic Synergy and the Lin Hao Archetype <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-three-basic-synergy-and-the-lin-hao-archetype" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Three-Basic Synergy and the Lin Hao Archetype&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Lin Hao (Entry 679)&#39;s growth trajectory is precisely the model of three-basic synergy: he practices Deduction-Iteration in the acceleration domain, Life-Cycle in the Quest domain, Spatial-Law Dispatch in cross-plane action. The three basics advance together, dual tracks synergize, walking a complete growth path. Any cultivator practicing only one basic will hit a bottleneck at some stage.</p><h2 id="v-three-basic-synergy-and-the-law-first-axiom" tabindex="-1">V. Three-Basic Synergy and the Law-First Axiom <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-three-basic-synergy-and-the-law-first-axiom" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Three-Basic Synergy and the Law-First Axiom&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Origin Three-Basic synergy is not empirical, but valid at the law level. The law-first axiom requires: Deduction-Iteration, Life-Cycle, and Spatial-Law Dispatch have a structural complementarity in the law network — deduction provides &quot;new solutions of laws,&quot; life-cycle provides &quot;embodied knowing of laws,&quot; spatial dispatch provides &quot;landing of laws.&quot; Missing any one, laws are incomplete: new solutions without embodied knowing are hollow; embodied knowing without new solutions is stagnation; landing without direction is blind motion. The three basics&#39; synergy outputs all backflow to the Alaya Network for Myriad Ranks to reuse. The three-basic synergy&#39;s law definitions are stable and self-consistent, not tilted by individual cultivator preference — this is the law-first axiom&#39;s expression on the cultivation system.</p><h2 id="vi-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">VI. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the three basics allocated to the time domain by nature, avoiding misallocation</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the three basics are fully public and fully non-predatory, the foundational textbook of the anti-predation axiom</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: in the Tang-Luo system the protagonist only practices the strongest manual; three-basic synergy is unheard of; Heng Yuan Zhou weights all three basics</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the three basics are the foundation of all Myriad-Rank cultivation, regardless of race</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: three-basic definitions, dual-track fit, pacing suggestions all public; newly merged cosmos automatically applies; may infinitely expand toward the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Origin Three-Basic are the cornerstones; the dual-track time domain is the runtime. Deduction-Iteration is fast in the acceleration domain, Life-Cycle is deep in the Quest domain, Spatial-Law Dispatch is solid across both tracks — triangle synergy makes cultivation fast, deep, and solid. Understanding the three basics&#39; synergy with the time domain is understanding the skeleton of Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s cultivation system.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./680_模块3-双轨时间域-时间域与三百套本源修炼体系.html">Entry 680 · Time Domain and the 300-Set Origin Cultivation System</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/11-推演迭代体系详解.html">Entry 11 · Deduction-Iteration System Details</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/12-生命循环体系详解.html">Entry 12 · Life-Cycle System Details</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/13-空间法理调度体系详解.html">Entry 13 · Spatial-Law Dispatch System Details</a></li></ul>`,28)])])}const p=i(o,[["render",s]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
